garage (2.4.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Package upstream release 2.4.1. Release notes:
    https://git.deuxfleurs.fr/Deuxfleurs/garage/releases/tag/v2.4.1
  * Ship upstream's static musl release binary, pinned by checksum.
  * Add a garage@.service template unit for running multiple instances.
  * Create the garage system user with sysusers.d. tmpfiles.d declares
    /etc/garage as 0750 root:garage, read-only to the service.
  * Restart running garage@ instances on upgrade with try-restart. Stopped
    and disabled instances stay stopped.
  * Maintainer scripts handle the standard arguments.
  * Ship a DEP-5 copyright file and this changelog.

